### API Router — sample requests
### Open in VS Code (REST Client extension) or JetBrains Rider and click "Send".
### The seeded demo API key works immediately.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = demo-key-please-change

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/health

### List seeded targets (admin-only management endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/targets
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List rules (admin-only)
GET {{host}}/api/rules
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create a regular (non-admin) user — admin only.
### The response contains the raw apiKey ONCE; only its hash is stored. Save it now.
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "teammate",
  "isAdmin": false
}

###############################################################################
# 1. Bundled fan-out: two sub-requests in one dispatch, returned together.
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/api/dispatches
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mode": "Parallel",
  "steps": [
    { "targetKey": "httpbin", "method": "GET", "path": "/uuid" },
    { "targetKey": "httpbin", "method": "POST", "path": "/anything",
      "body": { "hello": "world" } }
  ]
}

###############################################################################
# 2. The flagship demo: change the desktop wallpaper via an action target.
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/api/dispatches
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mode": "Sequential",
  "steps": [
    { "targetKey": "wallpaper",
      "parameters": { "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/1920/1080" } }
  ]
}

###############################################################################
# 3. Automatic requests: a schedule that rotates the wallpaper every 60s.
###############################################################################
POST {{host}}/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "rotate-wallpaper",
  "intervalSeconds": 60,
  "isActive": true,
  "dispatch": {
    "mode": "Sequential",
    "steps": [
      { "targetKey": "wallpaper",
        "parameters": { "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/1920/1080" } }
    ]
  }
}

### Inspect your dispatch history (including scheduled runs)
GET {{host}}/api/dispatches
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
